    "x": 41,
    "y": 915
   },
   "size": {
    "w": 778,
    "h": 158
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "c_spawn",
   "text": "Terrorists are the horde: knife only, 150 health, green. Counter-Terrorists defend with an M4 and armor.",
   "pos": {
    "x": 1041,
    "y": 23
   },
   "size": {
    "w": 2278,
    "h": 693
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "c_start",
   "text": "Each round is one stand: the horde waits, then wave 1.",
   "pos": {
    "x": 41,
    "y": 1843
   },
   "size": {
    "w": 2778,
    "h": 317
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "c_waves",
   "text": "Waves: hold out for 5. Between waves the fallen come back and everyone gets money.",
   "pos": {
    "x": 41,
    "y": 2205
   },
   "size": {
    "w": 3278,
    "h": 1058
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "c_deaths",
   "text": "Deaths: a defender who'd die is knocked down instead and bleeds out over 25 s (a teammate holding USE for 4 s gets them up: +200 for the helper); the base falls when no defender is standing; each zombie killed pays 300.",
   "pos": {
    "x": 41,
    "y": 1115
   },
   "size": {
    "w": 2278,
    "h": 711
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "c_shop",
   "text": "The armory: a real shop with a keeper at the map's Armory marker (else a defender spawn); walk up and press USE, or say !shop anywhere. Prices rise 5 % a wave; perks and the gun upgrade are on sale where the map has no machine or bench.",
   "pos": {
    "x": 41,
    "y": 3427
   },
   "size": {
    "w": 3278,
    "h": 580
   }
  }
